+`capture_status` RPC before accepting a take. It reports count and freshness for
+every required stream plus the current three-camera skew. A take is complete
+only when `all_required_advancing` is true. Camera producers must publish the
+three canonical names (`left_wrist_image`, `right_wrist_image`, and
+`top_camera_image`); the collection blueprint does not open camera devices on
+its own because the Render camera wall may already own them.
 
 The exact path is printed when the recorder starts — note it for the next step.
 
